WEBVTT

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.300
Iden: Clear.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.420
Hask: Okay. Those can't be all of them. Those Rebel commanders must have already moved on.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.260
Iden: We should too.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.500
Del: We're near Platform 4.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.200
Iden: Is there a shuttle there?

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:17.770
Del: No. TIE fighters only.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:19.320
Iden: Even better.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.900
Del: We should move carefully. We don't know how many Rebels are out here.

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:27.020
Hask: No, no. We'll deal with them the same as the rest. Today we wipe out that scum once and for all.

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:36.860
Hask: That's impossible.

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:50.960
Iden: Look alive, Agents. We can grieve later. Right now, we need to move.
